.TH VIXENPLUMB 1
.SH NAME
vixenplumb \- forward plumb messages to running vixen instances
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vixenplumb
.RB [ -d ]
.RI [ path ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Vixenplumb
registers the plumb destination
.B edit
and keeps track of running
.B vixen
editor instances, forwarding each plumb message it receives to
whichever instance is already editing the named file (or starting a
new one) rather than always opening a fresh window.
.PP
.RI [ path ]
restricts forwarding to files matching that pattern.
.B -d
enables debug output.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/cmd/vixenplumb.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR plumb (1)
